   "source": "# Finetune \u2014 Gemma 4 E4B agent distillation (QLoRA \u00b7 Unsloth)\n\n**Self-contained. Just press *Run All*.** GPU and Internet are preset in this notebook's\nsettings; no secrets, no setup, no external files are required.\n\nIt fine-tunes [`unsloth/gemma-4-E4B-it`](https://huggingface.co/unsloth/gemma-4-E4B-it)\n(ungated, 4-bit on load) to do three things a slide-deck agent needs \u2014 produce **deck-plan\nJSON**, **animation HTML**, and **tool calls** \u2014 from a synthetically generated, validated\ndataset, then reports a **before/after** comparison.\n\n_Optional:_ add an `Add-ons \u2192 Secrets` value `GOOGLE_API_KEY` to let a free teacher model\nenrich the data. Not required \u2014 it runs fully offline without it."
  },
